#. module: payment_mps
#. odoo-python
#: code:addons/payment_mps/models/payment_provider.py:0
msgid ""
"Fill in the API key from the MPS platform (Online › Get started) before "
"enabling or publishing MPS. MPS connects with an API key only; a client ID "
"and secret are no longer used."
msgstr "Saisissez la clé API de la plateforme MPS (En ligne › Commencer) avant d'activer ou de publier MPS. MPS se connecte uniquement avec une clé API ; un identifiant client et un secret client ne sont plus utilisés."

#. module: payment_mps
#: model:ir.model.fields,help:payment_mps.field_payment_provider__mps_api_key
msgid ""
"From the MPS platform, under Online › Get started. A test key starts with "
"mps_test_."
msgstr "Depuis la plateforme MPS, sous En ligne › Commencer. Une clé de test commence par mps_test_."

#. module: payment_mps
#: model:ir.model.fields,field_description:payment_mps.field_payment_provider__mps_gateway_url
msgid "Gateway"
msgstr "Passerelle"

#. module: payment_mps
#: model:ir.model.fields,help:payment_mps.field_payment_transaction__mps_check_count
msgid ""
"How many of the scheduled reads after opening the payment have been made."
msgstr "Nombre de vérifications planifiées déjà effectuées depuis l’ouverture du paiement."

#. module: payment_mps
#: model:ir.model.fields,field_description:payment_mps.field_payment_provider__id
#: model:ir.model.fields,field_description:payment_mps.field_payment_transaction__id
msgid "ID"
msgstr ""

#. module: payment_mps
#: model:ir.model.fields.selection,name:payment_mps.selection__payment_provider__code__mps
#: model:payment.method,name:payment_mps.payment_method_mps
#: model:payment.provider,name:payment_mps.payment_provider_mps
msgid "MPS"
msgstr "MPS"

#. module: payment_mps
#: model:ir.model.fields,field_description:payment_mps.field_payment_provider__mps_has_api_key
msgid "MPS API Key Set"
msgstr "Clé API MPS renseignée"

#. module: payment_mps
#: model:ir.model.fields,field_description:payment_mps.field_payment_transaction__mps_check_count
msgid "MPS Scheduled Reads"
msgstr "Vérifications MPS planifiées"

#. module: payment_mps
#: model:ir.model.fields,field_description:payment_mps.field_payment_provider__mps_is_test_key
msgid "MPS Test Key"
msgstr "Clé de test MPS"

#. module: payment_mps
#. odoo-python
#: code:addons/payment_mps/models/payment_transaction.py:0
msgid ""
"MPS approved %(approved)s of %(requested)s %(currency)s: a partial approval."
" Check before delivering."
msgstr "MPS a approuvé %(approved)s sur %(requested)s %(currency)s : une approbation partielle. Vérifiez avant de livrer."

#. module: payment_mps
#. odoo-python
#: code:addons/payment_mps/models/payment_transaction.py:0
msgid ""
"MPS cannot refund this payment right now: it has not been paid yet, or this "
"refund is still being processed. Try again in a moment."
msgstr "MPS ne peut pas rembourser ce paiement pour l’instant : il n’a pas encore été payé, ou ce remboursement est toujours en cours de traitement. Réessayez dans un instant."

#. module: payment_mps
#. odoo-python
#: code:addons/payment_mps/models/payment_transaction.py:0
msgid ""
"MPS could not make the refund (%s). Nothing was refunded; you can refund "
"again."
msgstr "MPS n’a pas pu effectuer le remboursement (%s). Rien n’a été remboursé ; vous pouvez rembourser à nouveau."

#. module: payment_mps
#. odoo-python
#: code:addons/payment_mps/models/payment_provider.py:0
msgid "MPS did not accept these credentials (%s)."
msgstr "MPS n’a pas accepté ces identifiants (%s)."

#. module: payment_mps
#. odoo-python
#: code:addons/payment_mps/models/payment_transaction.py:0
msgid "MPS did not return a payment to send the shopper to."
msgstr "MPS n’a renvoyé aucun paiement vers lequel diriger le client."

#. module: payment_mps
#. odoo-python
#: code:addons/payment_mps/models/payment_transaction.py:0
msgid ""
"MPS does not know this payment for this API key. A test key refunds only "
"test payments, and a live key only live ones."
msgstr "MPS ne connaît pas ce paiement pour cette clé API. Une clé de test ne rembourse que les paiements de test, et une clé live uniquement les paiements live."

#. module: payment_mps
#. odoo-python
#: code:addons/payment_mps/models/payment_transaction.py:0
msgid "MPS has not decided the refund yet. It is read again in a few minutes."
msgstr "MPS n’a pas encore statué sur le remboursement. Il sera relu dans quelques minutes."

#. module: payment_mps
#. odoo-python
#: code:addons/payment_mps/models/payment_transaction.py:0
msgid "MPS refused this refund (%s)."
msgstr "MPS a refusé ce remboursement (%s)."

#. module: payment_mps
#. odoo-python
#: code:addons/payment_mps/models/payment_transaction.py:0
msgid ""
"MPS refused this refund:\n"
"%s"
msgstr "MPS a refusé ce remboursement :\n%s"

#. module: payment_mps
#. odoo-python
#: code:addons/payment_mps/models/payment_provider.py:0
msgid "MPS rejected the API key."
msgstr "MPS a refusé la clé API."

#. module: payment_mps
#. odoo-python
#: code:addons/payment_mps/models/payment_transaction.py:0
msgid ""
"MPS sends this refund after %(until)s (UTC). Until then it can still be "
"canceled in MPS."
msgstr "MPS envoie ce remboursement après le %(until)s (UTC). Jusque-là, il peut encore être annulé dans MPS."

#. module: payment_mps
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:payment_mps.payment_provider_form
msgid ""
"Paste the API key from the MPS platform (Online › Get started) to enable or "
"publish this provider. MPS connects with an API key only: a client ID and "
"secret from an earlier setup are no longer used."
msgstr "Collez la clé API de la plateforme MPS (En ligne › Commencer) pour activer ou publier ce fournisseur. MPS se connecte uniquement avec une clé API : l'identifiant client et le secret client d'une configuration antérieure ne sont plus utilisés."

#. module: payment_mps
#: model:ir.model,name:payment_mps.model_payment_provider
msgid "Payment Provider"
msgstr ""

#. module: payment_mps
#: model:ir.module.module,shortdesc:base.module_payment_mps
msgid "Payment Provider: MPS"
msgstr "Fournisseur de paiement : MPS"

#. module: payment_mps
#: model:ir.model,name:payment_mps.model_payment_transaction
msgid "Payment Transaction"
msgstr ""

#. module: payment_mps
#: model:ir.actions.server,name:payment_mps.cron_check_payments_ir_actions_server
msgid "Payment: Read Open MPS Payments"
msgstr "Paiement : consulter les paiements MPS ouverts"

#. module: payment_mps
#: model:ir.model.fields,help:payment_mps.field_payment_provider__mps_webhook_secret
msgid ""
"Shown with your key in the MPS platform. Payment notifications are only "
"acted on when their signature matches; without a secret they are ignored and"
" orders are settled by the module's own checks."
msgstr "Affiché avec votre clé dans la plateforme MPS. Les notifications de paiement ne sont traitées que si leur signature correspond ; sans secret, elles sont ignorées et les commandes sont réglées par les propres vérifications du module."

#. module: payment_mps
#: model:ir.module.module,summary:base.module_payment_mps
msgid ""
"Take card and banking-app payments on the MPS-hosted checkout. Sends the "
"order amount, number and return addresses to MPS (Mobile Payment Solutions)."
msgstr "Encaissez les paiements par carte et par application bancaire sur la page de paiement MPS. Envoie le montant, le numéro et les adresses de retour de la commande à MPS (Mobile Payment Solutions)."

#. module: payment_mps
#. odoo-python
#: code:addons/payment_mps/models/payment_transaction.py:0
msgid "The payment failed at MPS."
msgstr "Le paiement a échoué chez MPS."

#. module: payment_mps
#. odoo-python
#: code:addons/payment_mps/models/payment_provider.py:0
msgid ""
"The payment provider rejected the request.\n"
"%s"
msgstr "Le fournisseur de paiement a rejeté la demande.\n%s"

#. module: payment_mps
#. odoo-python
#: code:addons/payment_mps/models/payment_transaction.py:0
msgid "The refund %s cannot be read: its MPS payment is not known."
msgstr "Le remboursement %s ne peut pas être lu : son paiement MPS n'est pas connu."

#. module: payment_mps
#. odoo-python
#: code:addons/payment_mps/models/payment_transaction.py:0
msgid "The refund was canceled in MPS. Nothing was refunded."
msgstr "Le remboursement a été annulé dans MPS. Rien n’a été remboursé."

#. module: payment_mps
#. odoo-python
#: code:addons/payment_mps/models/payment_transaction.py:0
msgid "The shopper left the MPS checkout without paying."
msgstr "Le client a quitté la page de paiement MPS sans payer."

#. module: payment_mps
#: model:ir.model.fields,help:payment_mps.field_payment_provider__code
msgid "The technical code of this payment provider."
msgstr ""

#. module: payment_mps
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:payment_mps.payment_provider_form
msgid ""
"This is a test key. It accepts only the MPS test cards: no card is charged "
"and nothing is paid out."
msgstr "Ceci est une clé de test. Elle n’accepte que les cartes de test MPS : aucune carte n’est débitée et rien n’est versé."

#. module: payment_mps
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:payment_mps.payment_provider_form
msgid ""
"This payment method sends the order amount, order number and your shop's "
"return addresses to MPS (Mobile Payment Solutions) to open each payment."
msgstr "Ce moyen de paiement envoie le montant et le numéro de la commande ainsi que les adresses de retour de votre boutique à MPS (Mobile Payment Solutions) pour ouvrir chaque paiement."

#. module: payment_mps
#: model:ir.model.fields,field_description:payment_mps.field_payment_provider__mps_webhook_secret
msgid "Webhook Signing Secret"
msgstr "Secret de signature des webhooks"

#. module: payment_mps
#. odoo-python
#: code:addons/payment_mps/models/payment_transaction.py:0
msgid ""
"Your MPS API key may not make refunds: it lacks the payments:refund "
"permission. A production key holds it only when MPS granted it, so ask MPS "
"to grant it to this key. A test key always holds it."
msgstr "Votre clé API MPS ne peut pas effectuer de remboursements : l’autorisation payments:refund lui manque. Une clé de production n’en dispose que si MPS l’a accordée ; demandez à MPS de l’accorder à cette clé. Une clé de test en dispose toujours."

#. module: payment_mps
#: model_terms:payment.provider,auth_msg:payment_mps.payment_provider_mps
msgid "Your payment has been authorized."
msgstr "Votre paiement a été autorisé."

#. module: payment_mps
#: model_terms:payment.provider,cancel_msg:payment_mps.payment_provider_mps
msgid "Your payment has been cancelled."
msgstr "Votre paiement a été annulé."

#. module: payment_mps
#: model_terms:payment.provider,pending_msg:payment_mps.payment_provider_mps
msgid "Your payment has been processed but is waiting for approval."
msgstr "Votre paiement a été traité mais est en attente d’approbation."

#. module: payment_mps
#: model_terms:payment.provider,done_msg:payment_mps.payment_provider_mps
msgid "Your payment has been processed."
msgstr "Votre paiement a été traité."

#. module: payment_mps
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:payment_mps.payment_provider_form
msgid "mps_live_…"
msgstr "mps_live_…"

